pg-ducklake (1.0.3-2PGSTY) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Repair and document the packaged-source build patch; verify source checksums.
  * Order LLVM objects after the bundled DuckLake patches.
  * Preserve distribution flags and bound LTO workers through PGXS.
  * Avoid the verified GCC final-link LTO runtime crash; keep LLVM bitcode.
  * Isolate bundled libpq configure from PostgreSQL backend-only flags.
  * Retain PostgreSQL 15-18 after the PG19 API audit; retire PostgreSQL 14.
  * Declare postgresql-common-dev for version-specific control generation.

